  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Aura</strong> moderate transmutation; <strong>CL</strong> 8th<br>\n<strong>Slot</strong> none; <strong>Price</strong> 8,000 gp (lesser), 32,000 gp (greater); <strong>Weight</strong> —</p>\n<p><strong>Description</strong><br>\nThis small sliver of crystal is completely translucent, although when attuned it flickers with a weak glow. A creature must attune themselves to a burn shard over 24 hours to use it. After a burn shard has been attuned, once per day it can accept 1 point of burn in place of its owner. A greater burn shard can instead accept 2 points of burn per day.<br>\nA creature can only attune themselves to one burn shard at a time.</p>\n<p><strong>Construction Requirements</strong><br>\nCraft Wondrous Item, creator must be an 8th level kineticist; <strong>Cost</strong> 4,000 gp (lesser), 16,000 gp (greater)</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/kineticist-magical-items#toc28\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": "<p>Selected profile: lesser burn shard; one point of burn per day; 8000 gp. Other variants remain in the complete source description.</p>",
